# SEQ > SWING per part: OFF plays the part straight, HOME's SWING still swings the others. Every part
# has it in the same place: the last row of SEL's list
wait 300
expect part 0
tap SEQ
expect noswing0 0
tap SEL
turn SELECT 20
shot noswing_909_list.png
turn ALGO -1
expect noswing0 1
expect noswing1 0
shot noswing_909_off.png
turn ALGO 1
expect noswing0 0
# 303 A
tap HOME
turn ALGO 2
expect part 2
shot noswing_303_seq.png
tap SEL
turn SELECT 20
shot noswing_303_list.png
turn ALGO -1
expect noswing2 1
expect noswing0 0
shot noswing_303_off.png
# the break
tap HOME
turn ALGO 2
expect part 4
tap SEL
turn SELECT 20
turn ALGO -1
expect noswing4 1
expect noswing2 1
shot noswing_break_off.png
# a copy of the pattern takes each part's SWING with it
tap HOME
press SAVE
tapkey w1
release SAVE
tap HOME
tapkey w1
expect pattern 2
expect ppat4 2
expect noswing0 0
expect noswing2 1
expect noswing4 1
